MeoArch OS Live

Plasma Wayland starts automatically as the Live user. The Installer opens
full-screen; closing it leaves the desktop, Konsole and Quick Repair available.
Choose Cage kiosk or terminal-only from the boot menu for alternate sessions.

Network connections are managed by NetworkManager. Use the graphical network
controls or nmcli for wired and Wi-Fi networks.

Documentation (or run Installation_guide):
https://github.com/QwQdoge/MeoArch-os-workspace/tree/main/docs
